  "content": "<p>These problems should be done before attempting the <a href=\"../../pages/readings/index.html\">end-of-chapter problems</a> or the <a href=\"../../pages/assignments/index.html\">problem sets</a>.</p>\n<p><table>\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th>\n\nPROBLEMS\n</th>\n\n<th>\n\nSOLUTIONS\n</th>\n</p>\n</tr>\n\n<p></thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor01/index.html\">Tutorial 1: Information, entropy, and source coding (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor01_sol/index.html\">Tutorial 1 solutions (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor02/index.html\">Tutorial 2: Error correcting codes (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor02_sol/index.html\">Tutorial 2 solutions (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor03/index.html\">Tutorial 3: Noise and bit errors (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor03_sol/index.html\">Tutorial 3 solutions (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor04/index.html\">Tutorial 4: Digital signaling (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor04_sol/index.html\">Tutorial 4 solutions (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor05/index.html\">Tutorial 5: LTI channels and intersymbol interference (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor05_sol/index.html\">Tutorial 5 solutions (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor06/index.html\">Tutorial 6: Frequency response of LTI systems and filters (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor06_sol/index.html\">Tutorial 6 solutions (PDF)</a>\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n<a href=\"../../resources/mit6_02f12_tutor07/index.html\">Tuto